Responsive layout
The home page’s skill panels appear in three columns on larger screens and stack on smaller screens:
.feature-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 1rem;
}
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
Readable spacing, visible keyboard focus, and descriptive image text support an accessible experience. Reusable classes keep design changes consistent across pages.
Reference: Quarto HTML theming
